      "label": "Endowment note",
      "as_written": "هذا النبويات وقف على طور سينا ما لا سلطان من الله يخرجها عنها عنها ومن اخرجها يكون محرم من فم الله و ملايكته",
      "translation": [
        "This prophetologion is an endowment for [the monastery of] Mount Sinai, and no one has authority from God to take it out from there. Whoever takes it out, may he be deprived of [the words of] the mouth of God and his angels"
      ]
    }
